      "title": "Investor sentiment improves as stock rises 19%",
      "body": "After last week's 19% share price gain to ₹150, the stock trades at a trailing P/E ratio of 12.9x. Average trailing P/E is 24x in the Basic Materials industry in India. Total returns to shareholders of 47% over the past three years.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
